    "%lld songs, each a PDF of its own" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%lld låtar, var och en en egen PDF"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A page couldn't be read from its PDF." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "En sida kunde inte läsas från sin PDF."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A part like Horn 1/3 is one part for both instruments. Say Horn 1 is set to 3 copies and Horn 3 to 2. If they share a stand, the higher number is enough. If each player needs their own, add them up." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "En stämma som Horn 1/3 är en enda stämma för båda instrumenten. Säg att Horn 1 har 3 exemplar och Horn 3 har 2. Delar de notställ räcker det högsta antalet. Behöver varje musiker ett eget, lägg ihop dem."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Add"
          }
        },
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Lägg till"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add Files…" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Add Files…"
          }
        },
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Lägg till filer…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add a name" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Lägg till ett namn"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add an instrument of your own" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Lägg till ett eget instrument"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add them up: 5 copies" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Summan: 5 exemplar"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add your first songs whenever you're ready." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Lägg till dina första låtar när du är redo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Added by you" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tillagt av dig"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Adds a blank back after a part with an odd number of pages, so each copy starts on a new sheet. Turn on double-sided printing in the print dialog too." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Lägger till en tom baksida efter stämmor med udda sidantal, så att varje exemplar börjar på ett nytt ark. Slå på dubbelsidig utskrift i utskriftsdialogen också."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Adds a blank back after a part with an odd number of pages, so every copy starts on a new sheet." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Lägger till en tom baksida efter stämmor med udda sidantal, så att varje exemplar börjar på ett nytt ark."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "All Are Right" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Alla är rätt"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "All of them will print. If these pages belong to another instrument, select them and change it. If this is right, keep them." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Alla skrivs ut. Hör de här sidorna till ett annat instrument, markera dem och ändra. Stämmer det, behåll dem."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Analyzing %@: page %lld of %lld" : {
      "comment" : "Progress label while one PDF's pages are being read",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Analyzing %1$@: page %2$lld of %3$lld"
          }
        },
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Analyserar %1$@: sida %2$lld av %3$lld"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Analyzing %@…" : {
      "comment" : "Progress label while a song's PDFs are being analyzed",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Analyzing %@…"
          }
        },
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Analyserar %@…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Back" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tillbaka"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Blank or excluded (won't print)" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tomma eller uteslutna (skrivs inte ut)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Brass" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bleckblås"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Built in. The name follows the language Copista is in." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Inbyggt. Namnet följer Copistas språk."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Cancel" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cancel"
          }
        },
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Avbryt"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Change Copies" : {
      "comment" : "Undo action name",
      "localizations" : {
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ändra antal"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Change these later under Copista > Settings, or go through this guide again from the Help menu." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Du kan ändra det här senare under Copista > Inställningar, eller gå igenom guiden igen från Hjälp-menyn."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose…" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Choose…"
          }
        },
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Välj…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Click to mark a page, ⌘- or ⇧-click for several. Drag to move. Space for a closer look." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Klicka för att markera, ⌘- eller ⇧-klicka för flera. Dra för att flytta. Mellanslag visar närbild."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Confirm Pages" : {
      "comment" : "Undo action name",
      "localizations" : {
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bekräfta sidor"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Continue" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Fortsätt"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Copies" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Copies"
          }
        },
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Antal"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Copies a new print job starts with" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Antal som ett nytt utskriftsjobb börjar med"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Copies of a part" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Antal exemplar av stämman"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Copista" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Copista"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Copista barely read the name, so the instrument is a guess. What it read is shown under each page. Change the wrong ones, then confirm the rest." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Copista kunde knappt läsa namnet, så instrumentet är en gissning. Det som lästes visas under varje sida. Ändra de som är fel och bekräfta sedan resten."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Copista will stop recognizing it. Pages already sorted for it keep it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Copista slutar känna igen det. Sidor som redan sorterats dit behåller det."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Copista will stop recognizing it. You can bring it back with Restore Built-in Instruments." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Copista slutar känna igen det. Du kan få tillbaka det med Återställ inbyggda instrument."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Deselect" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Avmarkera"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Done" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Klar"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Double-sided" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dubbelsidigt"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Drop PDFs or folders here" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Drop PDFs or folders here"
          }
        },
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Släpp PDF:er eller mappar här"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Drop in PDFs or whole folders, scanned or not. Files added together become one song, and Copista works out which page belongs to which instrument." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Släpp in PDF:er eller hela mappar, inskannade eller inte. Filer som läggs till tillsammans blir en låt, och Copista räknar ut vilken sida som hör till vilket instrument."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Drop zone. Drop PDFs or folders here, or use Add Files." : {
      "comment" : "VoiceOver label for the import drop zone",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Drop zone. Drop PDFs or folders here, or use Add Files."
          }
        },
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Släppzon. Släpp PDF:er eller mappar här, eller använd Lägg till filer."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each song is sent to the printer as its own job." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Varje låt skickas till skrivaren som ett eget jobb."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Exclude" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Uteslut"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Exclude Pages" : {
      "comment" : "Undo action name",
      "localizations" : {
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Uteslut sidor"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Exclude page" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Exclude page"
          }
        },
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Uteslut sidan"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Export Settings…" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Export Settings…"
          }
        },
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Exportera inställningar…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Files added together become one song. A folder is sorted into songs for you." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Filer som läggs till tillsammans blir en låt. En mapp sorteras i låtar åt dig."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "From a pile of PDFs to a stack of parts ready to print, with the right number of copies for everyone." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Från en hög PDF:er till en bunt stämmor redo att skriva ut, med rätt antal exemplar till alla."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Give at least one part some copies in the Copies step." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ge minst en stämma några exemplar under Antal."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Has issues" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Has issues"
          }
        },
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Har problem"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How do you print?" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hur skriver ni ut?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How many copies a new print job starts with. With 0 the instrument is left out, though you can still give it copies in a single job." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hur många kopior ett nytt utskriftsjobb börjar med. Med 0 utelämnas instrumentet, men du kan ändå ge det kopior i ett enskilt jobb."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How many copies of each part?" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hur många exemplar av varje stämma?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Import Settings…" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Import Settings…"
          }
        },
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Importera inställningar…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Include Score" : {
      "comment" : "Undo action name",
      "localizations" : {
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ta med partitur"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Include the score when a song has one" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ta med partituret när en låt har ett"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Instrument" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Instrument"
          }
        },
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Instrument"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Instruments" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Instrument"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keep" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Behåll"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Kept with the part before them, since no instrument was found in the top corners. If what's shown under a page is a new part's name, select that page and choose the instrument. The pages after it follow." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "De ligger kvar i stämman före, eftersom inget instrument hittades i de övre hörnen. Om det som står under en sida är namnet på en ny stämma: markera sidan och välj instrument. Sidorna efter följer med."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Looked for at the top of each page, and in file names. Any language; capitals and accents don't matter." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Letas efter överst på varje sida och i filnamn. Vilket språk som helst; versaler och accenter spelar ingen roll."
          }
        }
